why Ten Thistle Tea, the rogue energy drink, from the Horde lockpicking jobs at 16.

# The Horde Rogue level 16 quests:
# - Find the Shattered Hand (2378, Undead, from Mennet Carkad in the
#   Undercity) or To Orgrimmar! (2380, from Kaplak in Razor Hill) to
#   Shenthul in Orgrimmar's Cleft of Shadow, then Zando'zan (2379), Wrenix of
#   Ratchet (2382) and Plundering the Plunderers (2381, ten Thistle Tea).
# - Undead only: Fenwick Thatros and Tools of the Trade (1998, 1999) for
#   Mennet Carkad, in Silverpine Forest.
# Sources: Forever's Rogue class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for which quests Forever
# has, the rewards and Forever's changes (none for these quests);
# quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers, drops,
# vendors and places; travel.json for the inns and flight points.
# The two breadcrumbs exclude one another. To Orgrimmar!'s race mask takes
# any Horde race, so Orcs, Trolls and Skyborne take it from Kaplak.
# The leveling guides leave these out: they teach no spell.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Shenthul

step To Orgrimmar!
  only Orc,Troll,Skyborne
  zone Durotar
  tip At 16 Kaplak, the rogue trainer in Razor Hill, sends you to Shenthul in Orgrimmar.
  level 16
  accept 2380                                 -- Kaplak

step Find the Shattered Hand
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 16 Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter sends you to Shenthul in Orgrimmar. Take Fenwick Thatros from him too; it is done in Silverpine Forest at the end of this guide.
  level 16
  accept 2378                                 -- Mennet Carkad
  accept 1998

step Shenthul and Zando'zan
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Undead take the zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity to Durotar. Shenthul and Zando'zan stand in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength.
  turnin 2380 only Orc,Troll,Skyborne         -- Shenthul
  turnin 2378 only Undead
  accept 2379
  turnin 2379                                 -- Zando'zan
  accept 2382

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ratchet

step Wrenix the Wretched
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly or walk to Ratchet on the Barrens coast. Wrenix stands in town with his Gizmotronic Apparatus: buy an E.C.A.C. and Thieves' Tools from the apparatus before you go.
  getfp "Ratchet" optional
  turnin 2382                                 -- Wrenix the Wretched
  accept 2381
  buy 7970 x1 npc 7166                        -- E.C.A.C.: Wrenix's Gizmotronic Apparatus
  buy 5060 x1 npc 7166                        -- Thieves' Tools

step Southsea Treasure
  tip South along the coast from Ratchet, at the Southsea pirates' camp. If an unusually hostile parrot attacks you, use the E.C.A.C. on it (the quest's own advice).
  collect 7968 quest 2381.1                   -- Southsea Treasure

step Back to Wrenix
  turnin 2381 reward 7676                     -- Wrenix the Wretched: ten Thistle Tea

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undead: Silverpine Forest

step Fenwick Thatros
  only Undead
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to the Undercity and head south into Silverpine. Fenwick Thatros stands north-east of the Sepulcher.
  collect 7306 quest 1998.1                   -- Fenwick's Head: Fenwick Thatros

step Mennet Carkad
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  turnin 1998                                 -- Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter
  accept 1999

step Ambermill
  only Undead
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip The Kirin Tor keep their reports at Ambermill, in south-east Silverpine: pick the lock on the Ambermill Strongbox.
  collect 7309 quest 1999.1                   -- Dalaran Status Report: Ambermill Strongbox

step Back to Mennet
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  turnin 1999                                 -- Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter
